                    "content": "None of the major car rental companies in Los Angeles (SunSet Rent-A-Car, Speedy Rentals, LAX Car Rental) currently list electric cars among their available vehicle types\u2014they offer sedans, SUVs, convertibles, and trucks.\n\nHowever, here are the details for the companies with the highest ratings, in case you are open to other vehicle types:\n\n1. SunSet Rent-A-Car\n   - Rating: 4.5\n   - Price per day: $45.00\n   - Weekly price (7 days): $315.00\n\n2. Speedy Rentals\n   - Rating: 4.5\n   - Price per day: $48.00\n   - Weekly price (7 days): $336.00\n\n3. LAX Car Rental\n   - Rating: 4.1\n   - Price per day: $39.99\n   - Weekly price (7 days): $279.93\n\nSunSet Rent-A-Car and Speedy Rentals both have the highest rating (4.5). SunSet Rent-A-Car is slightly less expensive for a week.\n\nIf you specifically need an electric car, I recommend checking with specialized electric vehicle rental services or requesting a specific model directly from these companies. Would you like help with that?"
